      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is simply no way around this. People use VPNs, hardware spoofers, and different pc's in general. There are several ways to get around the bans, they just won't have the account for very long before that one gets banned. The only way I could see this working is if VRChat had ID requirements before playing the game, that way if someone tries to use a false name or fake identity, that'd be a federal crime, but I doubt that will ever be implemented.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
