      "value": "@{603fbe1486b8a2467efdd979|full_name}: forcing users to use a steam or oculus acc would make it harder than a vrc account. the vrc account should only be used for auth, the api and avatars and would need to be linked to a oculus or steam id and could only be changed on request or every 3 months",
