  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a current trend in popular maps where there are users mass harassing users with crasher groups, that have been getting around bans for years, if there is a way to make it harder for people to get back on after being banned it would be a nice thing to look into. (One guy has been harassing people for 2-3 years and has a active discord group dedicated to harassing streamers and cheating, ontop of them evading bans each time by just making a new account with a new email and bypassing them)\nI've personally had to reblock them myself multiple times because they somehow manage to teleport to me and try to talk to me, they even started crashing everyone when I blocked them, and this has been going on for months with them personally but they have gotten pretty infamous for doing it to others.\n<admin note: please don't post links to that content -- my own note: it was being used as a example calm down :(> is one of their leaders.",
